          1*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435443) '%3Cdiv+class%3D%22body_padded%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ch1%3EHelp+-+Command+Injection%3C%2Fh1%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctable+width%3D%27100%25%27+bgcolor%3D%27white%27+style%3D%22border%3A2px+%23C0C0C0+solid%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctr%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctd%3E%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EAbout%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+purpose+of+the+command+injection+attack+is+to+inject+and+execute+commands+specified+by+the+attacker+in+the+vulnerable+application.%0D%0A%09%09%09In+situation+like+this%2C+the+application%2C+which+executes+unwanted+system+commands%2C+is+like+a+pseudo+system+shell%2C+and+the+attacker+may+use+it%0D%0A%09%09%09as+any+authorized+system+user.+However%2C+commands+are+executed+with+the+same+privileges+and+environment+as+the+web+service+has.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ECommand+injection+attacks+are+possible+in+most+cases+because+of+lack+of+correct+input+data+validation%2C+which+can+be+manipulated+by+the+attacker%0D%0A%09%09%09%28forms%2C+cookies%2C+HTTP+headers+etc.%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+syntax+and+commands+may+differ+between+the+Operating+Systems+%28OS%29%2C+such+as+Linux+and+Windows%2C+depending+on+their+desired+actions.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+attack+may+also+be+called+%22Remote+Command+Execution+%28RCE%29%22.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ERemotely%2C+find+out+the+user+of+the+web+service+on+the+OS%2C+as+well+as+the+machines+hostname+via+RCE.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+allows+for+direct+input+into+one+of+%3Cu%3Emany+PHP+functions%3C%2Fu%3E+that+will+execute+commands+on+the+OS.+It+is+possible+to+escape+out+of+the+designed+command+and%0D%0A%09%09%09executed+unintentional+actions.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+can+be+done+by+adding+on+to+the+request%2C+%22once+the+command+has+executed+successfully%2C+run+this+command%22.%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3ETo+add+a+command+%22%26%26%22%3C%2Fspan%3E.+Example%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E127.0.0.1+%26%26+dir%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+has+read+up+on+some+of+the+issues+with+command+injection%2C+and+placed+in+various+pattern+patching+to+filter+the+input.+However%2C+this+isn%27t+enough.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EVarious+other+system+syntaxes+can+be+used+to+break+out+of+the+desired+command.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3Ee.g.+background+the+ping+command%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EHigh+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EIn+the+high+level%2C+the+developer+goes+back+to+the+drawing+board+and+puts+in+even+more+pattern+to+match.+But+even+this+isn%27t+enough.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+developer+has+either+made+a+slight+typo+with+the+filters+and+believes+a+certain+PHP+command+will+save+them+from+this+mistake.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E' ]
